 opinion:{name:'Task 2 · agree/disagree or opinion',steps:['Introduce the issue and give a direct position.','Develop your first reason: point → why → example → link.','Develop your second reason or a carefully explained qualification.','Conclude with the same position and main reasons.'],frames:['I [agree/disagree/partly agree] that [claim], because [main reasons].','One reason for this view is that [point]. This matters because [explanation].','For example, [specific realistic illustration]. This shows that [link to claim].','In conclusion, I believe [position] because [main reasoning].'],fields:[['focus','What exactly must you answer? What is your position?'],['point1','Reason 1 → why it matters → example'],['point2','Reason 2 or qualification → why → example'],['ending','What final judgement follows from these reasons?']],tips:['Answer the exact question; keep your position consistent.','A partly agree position needs clear limits: what do you accept, and what do you reject?','Develop a few relevant ideas rather than listing many.','Use realistic examples; named studies or invented statistics are unnecessary.']},
