function bankHTML(task,format){const task1=['data','maps','process'].includes(format);const groups=task1?[['Compare','whereas · compared with · similarly'],['Describe change','rose steadily · fell slightly · remained stable'],['Sequence / location','initially · subsequently · to the north of'],['Use accurately','rose to 25% = final value; rose by 5 points = amount of change']]:[['Give a reason','because · since · one reason is that'],['Show a result','therefore · as a result · this can lead to'],['Give an example','for example · for instance · such as'],['Qualify or contrast','however · although · may · in some cases']];return `<div class="writing-bank">${groups.map(([a,b])=>`<div><strong>${esc(a)}</strong><p>${esc(b)}</p></div>`).join('')}</div>${!task1?`<h4>Useful topic phrases</h4><dl class="writing-word-list">${topicWords(task.prompt).map(([a,b])=>`<div><dt>${esc(a)}</dt><dd>${esc(b)}</dd></div>`).join('')}</dl>`:''}<p class="small muted">Choose words you understand and adapt the frames to your meaning. A longer word or a memorised sentence does not automatically earn a higher band.</p>`;}
